  "question": {
    "text": "If both the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are less than unity, then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6QVwt",
      "text": "<math><mi>m</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "WGjis",
      "text": "<math><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEkpU",
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pJnVs",
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math> are the roots of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> implies that <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and the coefficients of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> have the same sign.</p><p>This gives <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Also, the discriminant is <math><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>So <math><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Taking intersection, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Also, note that if <math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> the roots are <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
